Founding record: 2026-11-17

EvoRig's original concept is a vehicle with a permanently unchanged
truck chassis and body, but an adaptive, evolvable drivetrain consisting
of four wheels, an engine and a gearbox/transmission. The drivetrain can
reconfigure during an individual simulated lifetime and its inherited
design can evolve over generations through a progressively harder,
physics-based MuJoCo terrain curriculum toward realistic human-world
terrain conditions over a proposed 10,000 training cycles.

